.TH FLOCK 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
flock \- apply or remove an advisory file lock
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/file.h>
.B int flock(int descriptor, int operation);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Operation is LOCK_SH, LOCK_EX, or LOCK_UN, optionally combined with LOCK_NB.
Linux associates the lock with the open file description.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fcntl (3crunch),
.BR flock (2)
